npx drizzle-kit generate
npx drizzle-kit migrate
```

If you are using the same auth config as I am you would get [this result for auth-schema.ts](https://github.com/miners-online/authserver/blob/4f2742dda15141797156ae3d8076aecb3c8002ad/auth-schema.ts)

